{"id":"firma","lemma":"фирма","pos":"noun","rank":2208,"glosses":["firm, company"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3e/Ru-%D1%84%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%84%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"фирмы","plural":"фирмы"},"examples":[{"text":"Он плохо вёл дела фирмы.","en":"He handled the affairs of the company badly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"bad, badly"},{"g":"to lead","l":"вести"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"деть"},null]},{"text":"Фирма моего отца на грани банкротства.","en":"My father's company is on the verge of bankruptcy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655872","words":[null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"father","l":"отец"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"facet, side","l":"грань"},null]},{"text":"Его смерть была большой потерей для нашей фирмы.","en":"His death was a great loss to our firm.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"death"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"big, large, great"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Фирма отказалась от того проекта.","en":"The company abandoned that project.","words":[null,{"g":"to abandon","l":"отказаться"},{"g":"from"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"project","l":"проект"}]},{"text":"Поговорите с менеджером фирмы.","en":"Speak to the manager of the firm.","words":[{"g":"to have a conversation","l":"поговорить"},{"g":"with / from"},null,null]}]}